cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the article given under preferred-citation and this archive."
type: software
title: "Code and data for: Positivity preservation in matrix-valued Caputo evolution equations: continuous problem, L1 time stepping, and residual-based neural networks"
abstract: >-
  Source code, configuration files, raw numerical results, tables and figures for Caputo
  time-fractional evolution of positive-semidefinite matrix states: L1 time stepping on uniform and
  graded meshes, sum-of-exponentials history, and physics-informed networks with admissible output
  maps. Benchmarks: verification experiments E1-E5, scalar and matrix-valued forward and inverse
  problems B1, B2, B6 and B7, a parametric surrogate, the laser-driven massive-Dirac model B3 and
  B4, and the conformation tensor of a viscoelastic fluid B5.
